{"4413380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SCP Foundation: Universe Horror", "steam_appid": 4413380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Containment has failed. Inside a secret Foundation facility, dangerous anomalies roam free and survival is now your primary objective. In SCP Foundation: Universe Horror, you explore, manage resources, avoid detection, and face unpredictable entities inspired by the SCP mythos. ⚠️<strong></strong>🏢 Explore &amp; Investigate<br><br>Move through dark, locked-down facilities filled with eerie corridors, sealed doors, and hidden threats. Progress by navigating dangerous environments where every area may hide an anomaly.<br><br>👁️ Avoid or Survive SCP Entities<br><br>Encounter iconic SCPs and new anomalies inspired by the universe. Each entity has unique behavior and attack patterns, forcing you to observe, react, and adapt.<br><br>🎒 Manage Resources<br><br>Survival depends on how well you handle limited resources. Plan carefully, avoid unnecessary risks, and make critical decisions that affect your chances of staying alive.<br><br>🤖 Unpredictable AI<br><br>Face dynamic AI behavior that keeps encounters tense and uncertain. No situation plays out exactly the same way twice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong>In this facility, fear is constant and safety is temporary. Step inside, but remember, not everything wants to remain contained.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Containment has failed. Inside a secret Foundation facility, dangerous anomalies roam free and survival is now your primary objective. In SCP Foundation: Universe Horror, you explore, manage resources, avoid detection, and face unpredictable entities inspired by the SCP mythos. ⚠️<strong></strong>🏢 Explore &amp; Investigate<br><br>Move through dark, locked-down facilities filled with eerie corridors, sealed doors, and hidden threats. Progress by navigating dangerous environments where every area may hide an anomaly.<br><br>👁️ Avoid or Survive SCP Entities<br><br>Encounter iconic SCPs and new anomalies inspired by the universe. Each entity has unique behavior and attack patterns, forcing you to observe, react, and adapt.<br><br>🎒 Manage Resources<br><br>Survival depends on how well you handle limited resources. Plan carefully, avoid unnecessary risks, and make critical decisions that affect your chances of staying alive.<br><br>🤖 Unpredictable AI<br><br>Face dynamic AI behavior that keeps encounters tense and uncertain. No situation plays out exactly the same way twice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong>In this facility, fear is constant and safety is temporary. Step inside, but remember, not everything wants to remain contained.</p>", "short_description": "Survive inside a secret SCP facility. Explore dark corridors, avoid or confront anomalous entities, manage limited resources, and outsmart unpredictable AI to stay alive in a world where containment can fail at any moment.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4413380/1a707223d033e447ec2d88b6df986384752ef07b/header.jpg?t=1787317352", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4413380/ec907f01ab1986c848121750b5186904aa80d022/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787317352", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4413380/ec907f01ab1986c848121750b5186904aa80d022/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787317352", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<s